I found a small bug.  If your pet is invisible, and you don't have the 
see invisible intrinsic, and are not blind, but are wearing an amulet
of ESP, then you can see your pet, but if you run into it, the safepet
doesn't stop you and you hit it.

I think the problem is in include/display.h:

#define canspotmon(mon) \
        (mon && (Blind ? sensemon(mon) : (!mon->minvis || See_invisible)))

There should probably be an extra "or" at the end to check for Amulets of
ESP (but not intrinsic ESP).
